    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "メジロドーベル",
            "enName": "Mejiro Dober",
            "jpText": "ライアン。次の休みなんだけど、\r\nなにか予定とか入ってる？",
            "enText": "Ryan, do you have any plans\nfor our next day off?",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": -4042010815607528549,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロライアン",
            "enName": "Mejiro Ryan",
            "jpText": "うん、筋トレ三昧で鍛えまくるつもりだよ！",
            "enText": "Yeah, I'll be training, working out,\nand building some muscle!",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -7896894922322347686,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロドーベル",
            "enName": "Mejiro Dober",
            "jpText": "そっか……わかった。\r\nケガだけは気をつけてね。",
            "enText": "Oh… okay. Be careful not to get\nany injuries then.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -6705093138596113905,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロライアン",
            "enName": "Mejiro Ryan",
            "jpText": "あれ……どこかに誘ってくれるつもりだった？",
            "enText": "Wait… Did you want to invite me out?",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -7075738003786857890,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロドーベル",
            "enName": "Mejiro Dober",
            "jpText": "えっ、べ、別に……ただ、\r\n最近一緒に出かけてないなって……。",
            "enText": "Huh? N-No… I just… I was thinking\nwe haven't hung out in a while, so…",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": 3298432979473306601,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロライアン",
            "enName": "Mejiro Ryan",
            "jpText": "……じゃあさ、映画でも行こっか！\r\n観たいのがあるんだよね！",
            "enText": "Okay, why don't we go see a movie?\nThere's one I've been wanting to see!",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": -8584718509339184685,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロドーベル",
            "enName": "Mejiro Dober",
            "jpText": "でも……筋トレは？　いいの？",
            "enText": "But… what about your workout?",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": 8233958216509730569,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロライアン",
            "enName": "Mejiro Ryan",
            "jpText": "あははっ！　筋トレはまた別の休み！\r\nもう頭の中が映画のことでいっぱいだもん！",
            "enText": "Ahaha! I'll do it on my next day off!\nNow the movie is all I can think about!",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": 7776141996975657414,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロドーベル",
            "enName": "Mejiro Dober",
            "jpText": "なにそれ……ふふっ、じゃあ映画で決定ね。",
            "enText": "Well that didn't take much convincing… haha.\nOkay, movie it is!",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": -101456839712647004,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロドーベル",
            "enName": "Mejiro Dober",
            "jpText": "あ、チケットはアタシが予約しとくよ。\r\n1番イイ席取ってあげる……！",
            "enText": "Oh, I'll reserve our tickets. I'll make sure\nwe get the best seats!",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": 7095786667340162577,
            "blockIdx": 10
        }
    ],
